From 61c33d6842895ea8d67b9b73dfba05cef2186c0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Troy Sargent <0xalpharush@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:44:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(verify): UniswapV2ERC20.transfer backend stages

Compile the port's UniswapV2ERC20 with solar at a pinned commit,
generate its stage proofs scoped to transfer(address,uint256) and the
checker-with-contexts certificate of its runtime bytes, and check them
in CI as the uv2_erc20 library under -M 6000. Generated files stay out
of the repository (Generated/ is ignored) since the port is GPL-3.0.
